! Basic file description: Whole Building test.
! Author:   R. H. Henninger,  GARD Analytics, Inc.
! Date:     January 9, 2007
! Run:
! Building: Geometry A with west oriented single pane window with external shade.
! Internal: Variable 15 W/m2, 50% radiant, 50% convective.
! Ventilation:  Option a - constant 1 ach
! System:   None.
! Plant:    None.
! Modified:

  Version,27.1;

  Site:Location,
    UNKNOWN,                 !- Name
